# tc-webshare Basic auth template - PLACEHOLDER ONLY, NOT A REAL PASSWORD.
#
# Format (one user per line):  username:crypt(3)-hash
# bozohttpd reads .htpasswd from the DIRECTORY OF THE REQUEST (it does not
# recurse).  install.sh places a link/copy in the web root and in cgi-bin/.
#
# The device has no htpasswd and no openssl, so install.sh requires a
# pre-computed hash in TC_WEB_PASS_HASH.  Generate it on the build machine:
#   openssl passwd -1 'your-password'          # -> $1$....
#   TC_WEB_PASS_HASH='$1$....' ./deploy/install.sh
# Neither the plaintext password nor any credential file is read or shipped
# by this repository.  Never commit a real hash here.
admin:REPLACE_WITH_CRYPT3_HASH_NOT_A_REAL_CREDENTIAL
